{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699930/extras/Green.gif?t=1746619140\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Orbs Orbs Orbs</strong> is a vibrant 2D precision clicker game. Clear the board by clicking to create a white ring that destroys the orbs. Unlock 4 distinct orb types in the demo and 6 in the full game, each with it's own unique behaviour. The demo features 25 levels from the full game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Orb Types:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Green</strong> \u2013 The balanced all-rounder</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Blue</strong> \u2013 Large and slow-moving#</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Teal</strong> \u2013 Small, light, and nimble</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Orange</strong> \u2013 Floats with reversed gravity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">Red</span></strong> \u2013 (Available in the full game)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">Pink</span></strong> \u2013 (Available in the full game)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every orb behaves differently, creating endless combinations of movement and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699930/extras/Orange.gif?t=1746619140\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Puzzle Elements &amp; Mechanics:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Seesaws and moving platforms add to the challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dead Zones stop you being able to click</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Destructible green blocks can alter your approach</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Attraction zones attract the orbs </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_strike\">Repelling zones repel the orbs</span>\u00a0(Available in the full game)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<span class=\"bb_strike\">Red zones destroy your white ring</span>\u00a0(Available in full game)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll need quick thinking, clever timing, and a little bit of chaos control to clear each board!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699930/extras/End.Levegif.gif?t=1746619140\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>Relaxing &amp; Chaotic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With soothing ASMR-inspired sound effects and colourful, physics-based interactions, <i>Orbs Orbs Orbs</i> delivers a unique mix of relaxation and energetic puzzle-solving. Levels can be calming or wildly unpredictable depending on how many orbs are in play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699930/extras/TightSpace.gif?t=1746619140\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Play Again:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your score is based on the number of attempts needed to clear the board.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You must secure at least two orbs to progress\u2014but aiming for three is the ultimate challenge!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Track your personal best time and score </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're looking for a casual, meditative experience or a high-score buzz, <i>Orbs Orbs Orbs</i> will keep you clicking, strategizing, and coming back for more!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3699930?t=1746619140","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3699930?t=1746619140","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass